{%- render 'glp1-assets' -%}
<div class="g1">
  <section class="g1-sec">
    <div class="g1-wrap">
      <div class="g1-gua">
        <div class="g1-seal"><b>Tug Test</b><span>MONEY-BACK GUARANTEE</span></div>
        <div class="g1-story">
          <div class="g1-eyebrow">The tug test guarantee</div>
          <h2 class="g1-h2"><span class="g1-gap">[GAP: guarantee length]</span> to see the hair hold on. If it doesn't, we refund every penny.</h2>
          <p>On day 1, before the 1st capsule, take a small bunch of hair near the scalp, about the width of a pencil, and give it a slow, firm tug. Count what comes away and write the number down. At the end of <span class="g1-gap">[GAP: guarantee length]</span>, do it again.</p>
          <p>If less doesn't come out, if the drain isn't lighter, and if the part isn't filling in, we refund every penny. <span class="g1-gap">[GAP: guarantee terms]</span></p>
          <p><b>The hair kept is hers. The risk is all ours.</b></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

